+# Integrated OpenVPN and OpenConnect
+Based on official MHSanaei/3x-ui v3.8.5, commit 7ef22f94c950ff09f0870e2295fa65ad5968742c.
+
+## Interfaces
+- /panel/openvpn and /panel/openconnect are native React/Ant Design pages.
+- POST /panel/api/masiha-vpn uses existing API authentication, token scope and CSRF middleware.
+- Root-owned /opt/masiha-vpn-extension/manager.py accepts JSON on stdin only. No public daemon/API is added.
+- Users can be created, renewed, enabled, disabled and deleted. OpenVPN exports per-user profiles; OpenConnect passwords are hashed using ocpasswd.
+- Accounts and quotas are separate from Xray; there is no combined subscription or traffic quota.
+- OpenVPN disabling revokes its certificate. Re-enabling generates a new certificate: download a new profile.
+- Expires are UTC Unix seconds (0 is unlimited); worker reconciles every 15 seconds.
+- Local audit records store timestamp/action/protocol/username, never passwords or keys.
+
+## Runtime
+- openvpn-server@masiha: UDP/1194, subnet 10.81.0.0/24.
+- ocserv: TCP+UDP/4443, subnet 10.82.0.0/24, public certificate for xu.chanelchat.ir.
+- masiha-vpn-extension.service manages expiry, NAT restoration after boot, and reloads ocserv after public certificate renewal.
+- Internal administration uses the root-only OpenVPN Unix management socket and occtl.
+- Existing subscription and Xray configuration are not modified.
+
+## Build and deployment
+Go 1.27.1 and Node 24.21.0 are installed under /opt/masiha-vpn-extension/toolchain.
+Run npm ci, npm run typecheck, npm run build inside frontend, then go build at repository root.
+Build candidate outside /usr/local/x-ui, run smoke_panel.py and test_tunnels.py before deploying.
+The tests create temporary users and isolated Linux network namespaces; they remove their own test accounts afterward.
+Backup binary and SQLite database before replacement. Stop x-ui, install candidate, start, test HTTPS and subscription.
+Backup files are held under /opt/masiha-vpn-extension/backups (root-only).
+
+## Updates
+An official 3x-ui binary update overwrites these custom routes and pages. Rebase this branch and rebuild for updates.
+The helper, service settings and account database remain independent. Preserve the original LICENSE and attribution.
+Do not commit account databases, password files, certificates or exported profiles to Git.
